| Code           | क्या मिलता है                    |
| -------------- | -------------------------------- |
| `now.tm_year`  | Year                             |
| `now.tm_mon`   | Month                            |
| `now.tm_mday`  | Day / Date                       |
| `now.tm_hour`  | Hour                             |
| `now.tm_min`   | Minute                           |
| `now.tm_sec`   | Second                           |
| `now.tm_wday`  | Weekday number                   |
| `now.tm_yday`  | Year का कौन-सा day               |
| `now.tm_isdst` | Daylight Saving Time information |


  सबसे जरूरी
now.tm_hour → Hour
now.tm_min  → Minute
now.tm_sec  → Second
एक साथ निकालना

  
  
  import time

now = time.localtime()

print("Hour:", now.tm_hour)
print("Minute:", now.tm_min)
print("Second:", now.tm_sec)



    याद रखने का तरीका 🧠
localtime()
    ↓
    now
    ↓
tm_year → Year
tm_mon  → Month
tm_mday → Date
tm_hour → Hour
tm_min  → Minute
tm_sec  → Second
